# JavaFX major version -> the version of its javadoc /JavaFX{major}/ serves,
# for Apache's RewriteMap "javafx". Each must be built, as one of the extras
# in pom-scijava's pombast.toml. The JavaFX LTS releases, plus the versions
# SciJava ships (19 in pom-scijava, 23 in Fiji); other majors get the next
# one up. JavaFX 8 (Oracle's) and majors newer than these are redirected
# upstream by the server config instead.
